      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRINGER'S BOY (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (25.80) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a good record here including three wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Rates on top in this line up. BINDY BLAZER (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 25.69 beating Tropic Sands. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. LOCHINVAR THOR (2) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (26.12) at Geelong. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. One of the better hopes. SHE'S PRIMED (8) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
